<p class="eyebrow" data-copy-en="Character guide" data-copy-zh="角色攻略">Character guide</p>
<h1 data-copy-en="Prince Barnard" data-copy-zh="Prince Barnard">Prince Barnard</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Find Prince Barnard’s daily circuit and the relationship gates for his tailor and court scenes." data-copy-zh="查找Prince Barnard的每日行程，以及裁缝店和宫廷事件的关系门槛。">Find Prince Barnard’s daily circuit and the relationship gates for his tailor and court scenes.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find them</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">What usually blocks the next step</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">去哪里找</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系进展</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">卡住时检查什么</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="If_Progress_Stalls"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Optional_Private-Client_Bookings"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Best_Scene_Choice_Bonuses"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Fernando.27s_Three-Scene_Thread"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Fernando's_Three-Scene_Thread"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="King.27s_Court_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="King's_Court_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Barnard.27s_Automatic_Scenes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Barnard's_Automatic_Scenes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Ordinary_Conversation"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Prince Barnard — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/barnard.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Prince Barnard — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/barnard.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Prince Barnard — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Prince Barnard participates in the royal-court route, Fernando’s tailoring scenes and Isolde’s connected story. His own repeatable interaction is conversation.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Where_to_Find_Him"></span><h2>Where to find them</h2><p>Daily: Royal Bedroom09:00–11:00, Castle Courtyard11:00–15:00, Noble Quarter16:00–19:00. On even days, Castle Garden20:00–22:00. Automatic shared scenes may use different locations and hours.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Supporting_Isolde.27s_Route"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Supporting_Isolde's_Route"></span><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>Meet him in the courtyard 11:00–15:00, then follow the three Fernando scenes below. Each tailor-shop scene starts 08:00–18:00; the listed relationship targets apply to both characters.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Automatic scene</th><th scope="col">Location / start window</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">A Prince In The Room</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Castle Courtyard; 11:00–14:59</td><td data-label="Requirements"></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Princely Adjustments</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Tailor Shop; 08:00–17:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Acknowledged (10); Fernando Known (25); after The Tailor Shop / A Prince In The Room</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Cut of Insecurity</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Tailor Shop; 08:00–17:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Known (25); Fernando Acquaintance (50); after Princely Adjustments</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Less Gold, Better Fit</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Tailor Shop; 08:00–17:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Friend (100); Fernando Friend (100); after The Cut of Insecurity</td></tr></tbody></table><p>For the court route, his individual stops need Acknowledged 10 at business Reputation 7 and 11, Known 25 at Reputation 15, then Acquaintance 50 for the Reputation 18 paperwork stage. Each still needs the immediately preceding court event; later shared scenes also check Vespa, King Graham and Lord Chamberlain.</p><p>For Isolde’s separate progression, keep Barnard at Acknowledged 10 for the first shared courtyard scene, Known 25 through the next two scenes, Friend 100 for the later courtyard scene, then Close Friend 200 for the remaining shared steps. Follow Isolde’s own dates and previous scenes rather than his ordinary portrait schedule.</p></section>
<section id="en-activities"><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / start window</th><th scope="col">Cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Prince Barnard</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Royal Bedroom / Castle Courtyard / Noble Quarter / Castle Garden; Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">15 min</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+1 base affection; 4/day</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Talk takes 15 min and gives 1 base affection, four/day shared across locations. There is no personal date or teachable-skill action in his current menu.</p><p>Favorite stats are Charm, Intelligence, Commerce. Learning Negotiation improves the relationship bonus.</p><p>Start times are shown; the ending hour is excluded. Base affection receives the relationship bonuses, while direct affection is added as listed. Ordinary affection, player Erotic Experience and NPC intimacy experience are separate.</p><p data-reviewed-service-addendum="true">Prince Barnard can also appear in the separate <a href="game-systems-brothel.html">Receive a Client</a> roster from business Reputation level 15. This requires the brothel branch and Netorare enabled; selection is random among eligible clients and uses the shared daily booking allowance. It is separate from his ordinary friendship and court scenes.</p></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><h2>What usually blocks the next step</h2><ul><li>For a tailor scene, raise Fernando as well as Barnard and complete the previous tailor event.</li><li>Guild Clout does not replace the Rose &amp; Thorn business Reputation gates.</li><li>A shared plot can occur outside Barnard’s normal portrait circuit; use the route’s event window.</li></ul></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="character-fernando.html">Fernando</a></li><li><a href="character-isolde.html">Isolde’s route</a></li><li><a href="character-vespa.html">Royal-court route</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-brothel.html">Business Reputation</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-If_Progress_Stalls"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Optional_Private-Client_Bookings"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Best_Scene_Choice_Bonuses"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Fernando.27s_Three-Scene_Thread"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Fernando's_Three-Scene_Thread"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-King.27s_Court_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-King's_Court_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Barnard.27s_Automatic_Scenes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Barnard's_Automatic_Scenes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Ordinary_Conversation"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Prince Barnard 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/barnard.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Prince Barnard 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/barnard.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Prince Barnard 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Prince Barnard参与宫廷路线、Fernando的裁缝店事件及Isolde的共同剧情。个人可重复互动为交谈。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Where_to_Find_Him"></span><h2>去哪里找</h2><p>每天09:00–11:00在皇家卧室，11:00–15:00在城堡庭院，16:00–19:00在贵族区；双数日20:00–22:00在城堡花园。共同自动事件可能使用不同地点与时段。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Supporting_Isolde.27s_Route"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Supporting_Isolde's_Route"></span><h2>路线与关系进展</h2><p>先在庭院11:00–15:00见面，再按下表推进三段Fernando事件。裁缝店事件均在08:00–18:00开始，双方的关系都须达标。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">自动事件</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">房间里的王子</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">城堡庭院；11:00–14:59</td><td data-label="条件"></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">王子的调整</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">裁缝店；08:00–17:59</td><td data-label="条件">已遇见（10好感）；Fernando 已知（25好感）；完成：裁缝铺、房间里的王子</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">不安的剪裁</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">裁缝店；08:00–17:59</td><td data-label="条件">已知（25好感）；Fernando 相识（50好感）；完成：王子的调整</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">少些金饰，更合身</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">裁缝店；08:00–17:59</td><td data-label="条件">朋友（100好感）；Fernando 朋友（100好感）；完成：不安的剪裁</td></tr></tbody></table><p>宫廷路线中，他的个人环节先在青楼声誉7和11时要求已遇见10，声誉15时要求已知25，之后声誉18的文书环节要求相识50。每段仍需前一宫廷事件；后续共同事件还会检查Vespa、King Graham及Lord Chamberlain。</p><p>Isolde的独立路线中，首次共同庭院事件要求Barnard已遇见10，接下来两段要求已知25，较后的庭院事件要求朋友100，剩余共同环节要求亲密朋友200。请按Isolde的约会与前置事件推进，不要只等Barnard日常头像。</p></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><h2>行动与奖励</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／开始时段</th><th scope="col">消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">与Barnard王子交谈</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">皇家卧室 / 城堡庭院 / 贵族区 / 城堡花园；陌生人（0好感）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">15分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+1；每天4次</td></tr></tbody></table><p>交谈消耗15分钟、增加1基础好感，各地点共用每天四次。目前菜单没有个人约会或可教技能。</p><p>偏好的属性为魅力、智力、商业。学会谈判可提高关系加成。</p><p>表中均为开始时间，不包含结束整点。基础好感受关系加成影响，直接好感按所列数值增加。普通好感、玩家情趣经验和NPC亲密经验分别计算。</p><p data-reviewed-service-addendum="true">青楼声誉等级15起，Prince Barnard也可能出现在独立的<a href="game-systems-brothel.html">接待客人</a>名单中。需选择青楼经营分支并开启Netorare；客人从合格名单中随机抽取，共用每天一次的预约额度，与普通友谊和宫廷事件分开。</p></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><h2>卡住时检查什么</h2><ul><li>裁缝店事件要同时提高Fernando与Barnard的关系，并完成上一段裁缝事件。</li><li>公会声望不能替代玫瑰与荆棘的青楼声誉。</li><li>共同事件可能发生在日常头像行程之外，请按路线规定的事件时段前往。</li></ul></section>
